# The ruling of Opalescence and Humility (2006-02-01): "If Humility has the earliest timestamp, then everything is 4/4."
# Humility (turn 1), then two Opalescences (turns 3 and 5): each Opalescence animates Humility and the other Opalescence
# (layer 4), Humility takes all three's abilities (layer 6), and in layer 7b its 1/1 applies first; each Opalescence's
# part goes on applying, its effect having begun in layer 4 (CR 613.6), and sets the other two to 4/4 after it.

